{"id":"rastro","lemma":"rastro","pos":"noun","rank":1661,"glosses":["sign, trace, vestige, scent","trail, spoor (i.e., marked indication to track and follow)","flea market, public market (especially El Rastro in Madrid)"],"ipa":"/ˈrastɾo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"rastros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/73/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-rastro.wav","examples":[{"text":"Desapareció sin dejar rastro.","en":"He disappeared without a trace.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/35226","words":[{"g":"to disappear","l":"desaparecer"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"to leave"},null]},{"text":"El rastro se ha enfriado.","en":"The trail has gone cold.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639779","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to cool, chill","l":"enfriar"}]},{"text":"Los caballos dejaron un rastro muy visible.","en":"The horses left a very visible trail.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728834","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"horse","l":"caballo"},{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"visible"}]},{"text":"Desapareció sin rastro.","en":"He disappeared without a trace.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531926","words":[{"g":"to disappear","l":"desaparecer"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"El ladrón huyó sin dejar rastro.","en":"The thief fled without leaving any traces.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"thief"},{"g":"to flee, to run away","l":"huir"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"to leave"},null]}]}